  ],
  "lyrics":[
    {
      "section_id":"section_1",
      "type":"intro",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"Attention, attention. Stup Virus",
          "rhyme":"ys",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"Enfilez vos protections Stup Virus",
          "rhyme":"ys",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"Careful careful careful, Stup Virus, Stup Virus, put on your virus protection",
          "rhyme":"$",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"« Un virus est une petite boule d'acide, entourée de protéines »",
          "rhyme":"in",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"AABC",
      "rhyme_vowel":"AABC"
    },
    {
      "section_id":"section_2",
      "type":"couplet",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"C'est bactériologique, truc chimique, stup fantôme",
          "rhyme":"om",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"Te rend paraplégique, psychotique, son posthume",
          "rhyme":"ym",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"Le truc te suinte par tous les pores, broie ton système",
          "rhyme":"Em",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"Ce virus est mortel, ouais pour la vie n'a pas d’estime",
          "rhyme":"im",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"Tu contractes des mélodies, t'as la « pied caisse-claire maladie »",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"Tu vas sombrer dans la folie, car ce son tue, c'est affolant",
          "rhyme":"#",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"Stup Virus, truc atroce, ça te laisse sans connaissance",
          "rhyme":"#s",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"Ta liste Spotify infectée par la Stup dance (Atchoum)",
          "rhyme":"#s",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"ABCDEFGG",
      "rhyme_vowel":"ABCDDEEE"
    },
    {
      "section_id":"section_3",
      "type":"refrain",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"Attention Stup Virus",
          "rhyme":"ys",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"Enlève-moi ce truc de la cervelle !",
          "rhyme":"El",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"Le Stup Virus nique ton cerveau, ta carte à puce",
          "rhyme":"ys",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"Attention Stup Virus",
          "rhyme":"ys",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"Comment je peux m'en débarrasser !",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"Mec c'est la poisse, c'est foutu, t'as les symptômes du Stup Virus",
          "rhyme":"ys",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"« Suffisamment pour éliminer des milliards de personnes... »",
          "rhyme":"On",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"ABAACAD",
      "rhyme_vowel":"ABAACAD"
    },
    {
      "section_id":"section_4",
      "type":"couplet",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"Stup Virus, truc vorace, fuite de son qui te laisse des puces",
          "rhyme":"ys",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"Te ronge la carapace, le truc te prend l'encéphallus",
          "rhyme":"ys",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"Ça fout la frousse, et sur youteub, vert est le pouce",
          "rhyme":"us",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"Ça provoque des secousses, y'a le bouton replay qui trépasse",
          "rhyme":"as",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"Stup Virus boule d'acide, ravagea la région nord",
          "rhyme":"OR",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"Toujours pas d'antidote tu ne fabriques plus d'anti-corps",
          "rhyme":"OR",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"C'est hypnotique, pas ton pote, couleur verte et boule d'azote",
          "rhyme":"Ot",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"C'est pas le son qui plaisante, le plus méchant des parasites",
          "rhyme":"it",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"AABCDDEF",
      "rhyme_vowel":"AABCDDDE"
    },
    {
